*.log

# node_modules is deliberately committed for the Companion module — Companion
# loads a developer module straight from disk and needs its dependencies sitting
# next to main.js, so a fresh clone has to be runnable as-is.

# npm CLI shim for a transitive dep, never executed — and a symlink, which a
# Windows checkout turns into a junk text file. The package itself is committed.
companion-module-jomboy-mlb-standings/node_modules/.bin/
